OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUS death row inmate Christa Pike awake
OL,4,Aand speaking after failed execution,
OL,5,Alawyers say
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe was sentenced to death following
OL,8,Fher conviction for murdering Colleen
OL,9,FSlemmer in 1995. But Pike survived two
OL,10,Flethal injections last Wednesday and
OL,11,Fwas transferred to a hospital in
OL,12,FNashville for treatment, where she
OL,13,Fremained unconscious while medical
OL,14,Fstaff cleared her body of the injected
OL,15,Fpentobarbital.
OL,17,FAn anaesthesiologist advising Pike's
OL,18,Fdefence team said her survival is
OL,19,Fhighly unusual.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
